#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Obsidian reference note embeds a native audio player — with no MP3 [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]in the public research repo, and with a failed TTS render never [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]blocking publication.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]research_swarm_listen_card.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/research_swarm_listen_card.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1g6[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1g6/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Swarm topology, audio contract, and linker listen card[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]swarm-listen-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]swarm-listen-card: in sase-research-artifacts make audio imply the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]linker, have audio wait on image and the linker wait on audio, give the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]audio agent a complete-on-failure var/artifact contract, teach the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]linker to write the listen card plus `audio:` frontmatter, flip the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]locking tests, and fix the docs drift in sase-research-artifacts and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase-listen.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob highlights create discovers and copies companion audio[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-audio-companion[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-audio-companion: add audio discovery (flag, frontmatter episode id, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]narration-script content hash against the sase-listen library), atomic [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]same-stem MP3 copy beside the intake PDF, collision guards, config, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]output, tests, and docs to `bob highlights create`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Listen-card banner and Play button in the Highlights PDF[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-listen-banner[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-audio-companion[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-listen-banner: render `listen` Divs as a dependency-free LaTeX [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]callout and, when create bound a companion, prepend a \"▶ Play\" button [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]linking to a configurable `obsidian://open` URI for the vault copy.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Scan carries audio into the library and embeds the player[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-scan-audio[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-audio-companion, bob-listen-banner[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-scan-audio: move same-stem audio with its PDF, late-pair orphan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]audio to an already-scanned PDF, add bob-managed `audio` frontmatter, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]insert the `![\\[lib/<type>/<stem>.mp3]]` player once below the PDF task, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]report orphans in doctor, and document it.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1g6","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1g6.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-70e35fd619ce2f22190c588ea321d736","started_at":"2026-10-04T22:41:13.440502+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"bf571346fc79a0cc8bdfa1afdf9904e02f45c2e2544ad49